<title>THAILAND: Alphatec pays 6.50 bht year dividend.</title>
<headline>Alphatec pays 6.50 bht year dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	    6.50    vs    11.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	   April 3, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	  N.A.</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Alphatec Electronics Plc, an integrated circuit producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
</text>
